{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:32:18.380Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"911c51e9d6c1675f5584af58d8d503e2e4ea34ff25cca53bf150ba3672b304b6","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's Strategic digests say. Two of the four owners are firm, one is an inference, and one isn't stated anywhere.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. Nadia Fennimore owned it before. It changed hands on **Monday, 2026-05-04**. The 5/3 Sunday prep says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment took effect that day.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. He has run it since at least the 7/7/2025 digest, and the 5/4/2026 digest says he \"also assumed management\" of it. The digests don't say whether that was a change or a restatement.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, but this is inferred. The digests never name the account and the owner together. They call it \"Gideon's medical account\" in 12/2025 and again in 9/2026, and the 9/30 digest has Orlavine at 55 seats. Nadia held it in March 2025, and the digests don't record the handoff. Please confirm in the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests don't name an owner. They only call it the pod's \"retail\" or \"outdoor\" account. Nadia volunteered to run its gate-clerk training on 10/2, but that doesn't make her the owner. I'd check the CRM or ask Moss.\n\nThe latest digest I can see is 9/30, so any change after that wouldn't show up here."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
